# These files are deployed to Linux servers, so keep LF line endings
# everywhere. Without this, Git for Windows rewrites them to CRLF on
# checkout and every file shows as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.dotx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
